strong>Jekyll=E2=80=99s</strong> site <code>url</code> and <code>baseurl</c=
ode> variables cause a lot of confusion for users. I see it all the time in=
 the <a href=3D"https://talk.jekyllrb.com/" rel=3D"noopener"><strong>Jekyll=
