</span></span></span><span class=3D"line"><span class=3D"cl"><span class=3D=
"w"></span><span class=3D"nt">permalink</span><span class=3D"p">:</span><sp=
an class=3D"w"> </span><span class=3D"l">date</span></span></span></code></=
pre></div></li></ol><h3 id=3D"markdown-links"><a href=3D"https://mademistak=
es.com/mastering-jekyll/site-url-baseurl/#markdown-links" title=3D"Permalin=
k to Markdown links">Markdown links</a></h3><p>How to link to pages, posts,=
 and images in Markdown.</p><h4 id=3D"page-in-root-directory"><a href=3D"ht=
tps://mademistakes.com/mastering-jekyll/site-url-baseurl/#page-in-root-dire=
ctory" title=3D"Permalink to Page in root directory">Page in root directory=
</a></h4><div class=3D"highlight"><pre tabindex=3D"0" class=3D"chroma"><cod=
e class=3D"language-markdown" data-lang=3D"markdown"><span class=3D"line"><=
span class=3D"cl">[<span class=3D"nt">about page</span>](<span class=3D"na"=
>/about.html</span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table><thead><tr><th>=
HTML output</th><th style=3D"text-align:center">-</th></tr></thead><tbody><=
tr><td><code>&lt;a href=3D"/about.html"&gt;about page&lt;/a&gt;</code><br>U=
RL is missing the base URL of <code>/blog</code> from the path.</td><td sty=
le=3D"text-align:center">=E2=9D=8C</td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id=3D"page-=
in-sub-directory"><a href=3D"https://mademistakes.com/mastering-jekyll/site=
